<title>USA: Socket, Cetronic AB to merge.</title>
<headline>Socket, Cetronic AB to merge.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Socket Communications Inc said Wednesday it plans to merge with Cetronic AB, a privately held Swedish company that develops and markets software and hardware for the wireless data communications markets.</p>
<p>Under the proposed terms of the merger, Socket will issue $11.4 million in Socket common stock in exchange for all of the common shares of Cetronic AB.</p>
<p>The merger, to be accounted for as a purchase, is subject to a definitive merger agreement expected to be completed by the end of May, and will require the approval of the shareholders of both companies.</p>
</text>
